# Normalise every text file to LF inside the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks the shell
# scripts out with CRLF line endings, and a shebang line ending in a carriage
# return makes Linux report "bad interpreter: No such file or directory".
# Chapter 66 explains the whole mechanism.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-native tooling, kept as CRLF on purpose.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
